            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Alan Greenspan</strong><br>\nAlan Greenspan was born on March 6, 1926, in New York City. He grew up in the Washington Heights neighborhood with his parents, Herbert Greenspan and Rose Goldsmith. Greenspan showed an early aptitude for numbers and music, attending George Washington High School. His interest in economics began to develop during his teens, influenced by the economic atmosphere of the Great Depression era.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Education and Early Career</strong><br>\nGreenspan studied economics at New York University (NYU) where he earned his Bachelor's, Master's, and later, a Ph.D. in economics. He did not complete his doctorate until 1977, long after he had already made a name for himself in economic circles. Before finishing his Ph.D., Greenspan worked as an analyst at The National Industrial Conference Board.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Greenspan's Work in Private Sector</strong><br>\nBefore his tenure at the Federal Reserve, Alan Greenspan had a prolific career in the private sector. He served as chairman of the Council of Economic Advisers under President Ford. He also ran Townsend-Greenspan &amp; Co., a consulting firm that provided economic analysis to businesses, for over 30 years.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
